{"id":"29802849e85128b9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-sperner.md","title":"Sperner family","display":"df-sperner — Sperner family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-sperner","aliases":["27-df-sperner"],"display":"df-sperner — Sperner family","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-sperner"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-sperner</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sperner — Sperner family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is a set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sperner}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sperner}\\)</span> is the predicate to be defined on set families.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to A=B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to A=B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.2.1, discussion preceding Theorem 4.19，印刷页 177，PDF 第 201 页（从 1 计数）。 即包含序下的反链；这里集合族可以为空，也可以含空集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sperner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sperner}(\\mathcal F)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to A=B).","display":true}],"bytes":730,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-sperner|df-sperner — Sperner family]]"},{"id":"6e57c20334785069","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$, $\\mathrm{PI}$ and $\\mathrm{Sperner}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]], [[27-df-piset]] and [[27-df-sperner]]; $T_L$ is defined in [[27-df-term]]."}],"outgoing":[]}